{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/add_to_wishlist.gif?t=1747027395\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plot and comedy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a lonely game developer. Finding yourself in a fantasy world threatened by the <strong>Singularity Dragon</strong>, you have the opportunity to <strong>summon a harem of catgirls</strong>! The problem is that you first need to assemble this harem and make friends with each of the candidates...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/Line1.png?t=1747027395\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel with your squad</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features <strong>12 cute catgirls</strong>, each of which has its own unique fighting skills and nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the &quot;<strong><i>Summon Harem</i></strong>&quot; ability to immediately teleport up to 4 selected <strong>catgirls</strong> from your harem to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create <strong>buildings</strong> and <strong>synergy</strong> of your harem to more effectively explore a dangerous and colorful world inhabited by fairy-tale creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your charisma and courage to pave the way to sensitive hearts and together save the world from destruction!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/Line2.png?t=1747027395\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/2025-04-22_16-59-20_-_frame_at_10m54s.jpg?t=1747027395\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/mpv-shot0003.jpg?t=1747027395\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cool gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The locations are full of <strong>activities</strong>and <strong>secrets</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exciting <strong>boss battles</strong> where you are not alone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Funny dialogues</strong> with answer options are combined with a <strong>deep plot</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have many <strong>abilities</strong> and the ability to improve them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple endings and hardcore achievements!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2740020?t=1747027395","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2740020?t=1747027395","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/0028cb4318a488a6449f121eae52033a3a665936/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747027395","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/0028cb4318a488a6449f121eae52033a3a665936/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747027395","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/add_to_wishlist.gif?t=1747027395\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plot and comedy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a lonely game developer. Finding yourself in a fantasy world threatened by the <strong>Singularity Dragon</strong>, you have the opportunity to <strong>summon a harem of catgirls</strong>! The problem is that you first need to assemble this harem and make friends with each of the candidates...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/Line1.png?t=1747027395\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel with your squad</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features <strong>12 cute catgirls</strong>, each of which has its own unique fighting skills and nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the &quot;<strong><i>Summon Harem</i></strong>&quot; ability to immediately teleport up to 4 selected <strong>catgirls</strong> from your harem to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create <strong>buildings</strong> and <strong>synergy</strong> of your harem to more effectively explore a dangerous and colorful world inhabited by fairy-tale creatures!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your charisma and courage to pave the way to sensitive hearts and together save the world from destruction!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/Line2.png?t=1747027395\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/2025-04-22_16-59-20_-_frame_at_10m54s.jpg?t=1747027395\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2740020/extras/mpv-shot0003.jpg?t=1747027395\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cool gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The locations are full of <strong>activities</strong>and <strong>secrets</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exciting <strong>boss battles</strong> where you are not alone!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Funny dialogues</strong> with answer options are combined with a <strong>deep plot</strong>.</p><